{
"content_id": "735777",
"reference_id": 22201,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Abdias 1.10–14",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "31001010-31001014",
"language": "fra",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>À cause de ta violence contre ton frère Jacob : la principale raison de la condamnation d&apos;Ésaü est énoncée en <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"31001010\" data-end-ref=\"31001010\">1.10</data> (cf. <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23034001\" data-end-ref=\"23034017\">Es 34</data> ; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24049007\" data-end-ref=\"24049022\">Jr 49.7–22</data> ; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29003019\" data-end-ref=\"29003019\">Jl 3.19</data> ; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"30001011\" data-end-ref=\"30001012\">Am 1.11–12</data>) et amplifiée en <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"31001011\" data-end-ref=\"31001014\">1.11–14</data>, où sa trahison est développée. <span>D&apos;un point de vue juridique, ces versets confirment l&apos;accusation de rupture d&apos;alliance.</span></p>",
"associations": {
